  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-05-06T00:32:53.047Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When I want to actually 'move' in holoport, I have to stop the avatar so I can teleport to where it is, then start moving the avatar again.\nThis makes going up hills and down cliffs really annoying because terrain limits how far away I can point the cursor, so I have to stop more often to 'confirm' the move.\nThere should be an option to AUTOMATICALLY jump to the avatar's location when it reaches the cursor, so that we can move without these frequent pauses.",
